From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] clk: mstar: SSD20xD clock generator, PLLs and muxes

The clock generator (clkgen), the LPLL, UPLL and MIU PLL, the PM and SC GP muxes beside the mainline
CPU PLL and MPLL. The UARTs, the SPI flash controller and the EMAC take their clocks from these.

Origin: https://github.com/linux-chenxing/linux.git mstar_v6_5_rebase 5de660288cdf709dd40882bc57170f81ab744dea
